  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Convention on Anti-personnel Landmines - APLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norway&apos;s contributions to the Convention on the Prohibition of the Use, Stockpiling, Production and Transfer of Anti-Personnel Mines and on their Destruction - APLC. Contributions to annual budgets and voluntary contrubutions to the APLC trust fund. The main objective is capacity building of developing countries&#x2019; capability to comply with the convention, for the protection of civilians from the harm from weapons in armed conflicts.</narrative>
  </description>
